[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Niko1221/Strata/issues/comments/5875643678","html_url":"https://github.com/Niko1221/Strata/pull/62#issuecomment-5875643678","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Niko1221/Strata/issues/62","id":5875643678,"node_id":"IC_kwDOUpvcvc8AAAABXjc1Hg","user":{"login":"Niko1221","id":86886444,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2ODg2NDQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86886444?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Niko1221","html_url":"https://github.com/Niko1221","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Niko1221/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Niko1221/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Niko1221/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Niko1221/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Niko1221/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Niko1221/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Niko1221/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Niko1221/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Niko1221/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-28T18:00:10Z","updated_at":"2026-09-28T18:00:10Z","body":"Thanks @j-luwierski - clean and well tested (7/7 here too). Merged in [v0.1.20](https://github.com/Niko1221/Strata/releases/tag/v0.1.20) together with #65's idea: a prompt read from token 0 is also checkpointed at the end of its system prompt when that's 2,048 tokens or more (`--prompt-cache-root N`, 0 = off). Without it the root only existed for system prompts past `--prompt-cache-every` (16K), so a 30K prompt reused 16,384 tokens, not all of it. Measured now: a new chat reuses a 3,883-token system prompt whole, also after 5 turns of another chat with 3 slots.","author_association":"OWNER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Niko1221/Strata/issues/comments/5875643678/reac